            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Paralysis"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation, occult, necromancy)\n\nAny living creature hit by a ghast's attack must succeed at a DC 15 Fortitude save or become paralyzed. It can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such save."
